# Leave the key empty to run in replay mode (recorded outputs, no internet needed).
# With a key, every AI desk calls Claude directly from the browser.
# WARNING: VITE_ variables are built into the page. Use a training key with a low spending limit,
# and never deploy a build that contains a real key.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
VITE_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
